    "Motif has no servers and no analytics. Your history stays on your devices and in your iCloud account." : {

    },
    "Motif keeps what you play either way. Access lets it fill in songs from Recently Played, find artwork, and add radio songs to your playlist." : {

    },
    "Motif only notices what's playing while it's running. Opening it at login means nothing gets missed." : {

    },
    "Motif only sees music while it's open. The rest comes from Apple Music's Recently Played, which doesn't say how or exactly when you played them. Motif checks it whenever it opens, and now and then in the background, unless you swipe it away in the app switcher." : {

    },
